WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.730
Why a kid? Why a kid?

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.520
Why a kid?!

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.660
You run pretty slow.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.580
If you want to be a thief, you 
need to be able to run faster,

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.870
Mr. Tattoo Thief.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.960
What is your deal, brat?!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.420
You're too stiff.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:33.880
Relax your muscles.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.850
Don't try to suppress the abilities 
that the tattoo has boosted for you.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.810
Be more natural.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:43.350
I'm getting sick of hearing you say that!

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.230
Oh, yeah. That was a good one.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.440
What is your deal, brat?

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:56.660
<i>Too close... I'd be in trouble if 
that had happened during the fight.</i>

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:00.330
Your tattoo's drive lasts about ten minutes.

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:03.910
Think carefully about the right 
timing to reload your trigger.

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:07.000
There's no point in using up 
a large amount at one time.

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:08.710
Right. I'll be careful.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.170
I guess I still need more training...

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:17.010
<i>It's only been two weeks since 
he learned to use the tattoo.</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:19.260
<i>He's adapted abnormally quickly.</i>

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:23.270
<i>And on top of that, he's 
the match for Void Maker.</i>

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.980
<i>One might say he's a godsend to tattoos.</i>

00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:01.160
Distance

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:05.200
I guess the parents have left the den...

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:06.700
Oh, well.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.870
Get by on your own from now on.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.960
I have to get to work.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:35.270
Who wants coffee?

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:36.360
I do.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.580
The tattoo detector!

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.720
Be careful you don't hit each other!

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.480
David!

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.720
Wow, 3.56 meters!

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.390
From a standing position?!

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.300
That was incredible, Ichinose!

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.180
You jump like a sow!

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.560
I think you mean a serow...

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.100
You could take on the world!

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:58.190
Why don't you join the track team 
and maximize those muscles?!

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:00.650
I-It was just a fluke!

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.320
Hey, Touko-chan, are your 
jumps always that long?

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:06.820
No, they've been kind of hyperbolic lately...

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.030
It's like my body feels really light.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.040
<i>It's activating?</i>

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:15.540
<i>Then she should be extra-sensitive, too...</i>

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.920
Izzy-san! What are you doing?!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.920
Sorry. I couldn't resist.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.340
<i>Lieutenant! It's an emergency!</i>

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.380
<i>We have a request for backup from White Rose!</i>

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.550
I don't know the details,

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.680
but please hurry to their hideout!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.220
I'm heading there, too.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:32.890
Gotouza-sensei...

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:33.980
What is it?

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:37.690
Due to circumstances beyond my 
control, I need to leave early.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:39.770
What are you talking about?

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.020
Please.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:44.900
<i>An enemy?</i>

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.860
<i>No... It's picking up Izzy's signal.</i>

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.530
<i>Why is she activating her tattoo at school?</i>

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.370
Sensei, gotta go! Number 2!

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:54.200
What?

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.250
What happened?

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.630
<i>A tattoo user can't get 
out of drive on their own.</i>

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.840
<i>That means Izzy left the detection range.</i>

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:12.430
<i>There she is!</i>

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:14.390
Izzy!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.730
Time to stop being naughty, stray cat girl.

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:24.570
You're Schrödinger's Cat, right?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:28.150
You can turn air into combustible matter?

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.450
Looks like the fuse is elsewhere, though.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.580
How did you get in here?

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:33.990
That's a secret.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.120
Yeah, I guess it would be.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:38.080
You can't show your cards to the enemy.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.290
Still, you have some nerve.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:44.050
You barge in when we're all 
happily hanging out in here,

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:46.920
then you murder my precious underlings.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:48.590
Don't think...

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.640
that I'll let you leave here in one piece.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:55.600
The impudence of fools who offend 
my princess is overwhelming.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:57.930
Die.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:01.020
Don't come crying to me when 
you're reduced to cinders!

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.460
How are you right there?

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.920
<i>Did she pass through the wall?</i>

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.100
<i>Lisa...</i>

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.450
M-My body feels so heavy...

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:53.490
Why?

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:56.990
I figured if I set it up around 
here, you'd fall for it,

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.370
little bunny.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:01.330
The noise canceler system...

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.960
Chains made for binding Sealed.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.130
A system?

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:09.130
No fancy machines are 
needed to work a tattoo.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:12.800
All they need is a human brain and a trigger.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:14.300
<i>He can't mean...</i>

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:18.470
And since my tattoo isn't active,

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:20.470
it's this easy for me to...

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:21.390
Bang.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:23.850
I'm joking.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.860
Junior wouldn't allow me to

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:28.070
kill someone in such a tacky way.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.650
You just sit there and watch for a while.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:39.580
Izzy! You okay?!

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.870
You can move?

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:44.500
Something happened, right? I'm here to help.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.040
You followed me here?

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:50.130
Of course. Isn't that what partners do?

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:54.130
Well, this is a problem...

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.890
You're a real monster.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:05.190
Your ability is to obscure
your own presence, right?

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.650
That's how you can both possess people

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.610
and pass through walls.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.690
You're half right and half wrong.

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:15.570
I will collect you as a sample.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:17.820
Nice joke.

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:20.410
If I let it end here,

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.910
I'll never forgive myself!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:29.340
She's exploding?

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:35.800
What is that smoke?

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:37.130
Lisa!

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:38.890
There's a friend over there, right?

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:44.350
Seigi, I'll be fine. Just go!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.810
Lisa... Lisa needs your help!

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.190
O-Okay!

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:55.070
<i>I've never seen Izzy look so shaken.</i>

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.580
<i>What is this?</i>

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:09.250
<i>It's so frustrating...</i>

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:12.920
<i>Why can't I stop my tattoo on my own?</i>

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.220
What the hell is this?

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.750
You're that girl from before...

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:55.250
Why are you here?

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.010
Did you do that to those guys inside?

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:00.630
You want to die that badly?

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.430
Answer the question!

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.970
I asked you if you did that to them!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:06.220
Yes.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.100
Why?

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.650
Why did you have to do that?!

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.270
Is there some reason you had to kill them?!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:17.360
You are a child who's been spoiled by peace.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.950
You take being alive for granted.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:23.950
And you don't... You don't think 
anything of killing people?!

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:26.240
Get a clue already.

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.750
In the world you and I live in,

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:32.710
being alive means controlling 
and defeating everyone else.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.750
Being kind will kill you.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:38.760
I don't understand you!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:40.590
No, I don't want to understand you!

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.390
Just give that woman back right now!

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:51.810
If you want to live your own way, it's best to control your opponent with violence.

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:55.520
That is the only law that 
exists in this world.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:00.690
Tom-san!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.200
Seigi-kun, why are you here?

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.660
Why? Because Izzy asked me to!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:11.830
She asked me to save the woman named Lisa.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:13.370
The lieutenant did?

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:15.670
Izzy's friend is my friend, too!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:16.670
I have to save her!

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:17.540
Seigi-kun!

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:20.340
I appreciate that sentiment,

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:23.050
but we can't have you facing 
the enemy recklessly.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:26.350
Your existence is a secret known only to us.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:28.510
Huh? What does that mean?

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:29.520
Hide!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:39.110
They wish to declare war?

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:40.440
Glint!

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:40.440
Glint!

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.150
Gah! My organs!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:59.290
I won't accept it.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.130
Touko? What are you doing here?

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.760
I know the way you think.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:09.050
Where'd you go? Was Izzy-san with you?

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.430
Where... I...

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:16.600
What's wrong? You're acting weird.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:18.690
Did something dangerous happen again?

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:19.730
No.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:21.570
It's nothing.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.610
It is not nothing!

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:25.530
Tell me!

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:28.780
You wouldn't understand if I did!

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:30.030
Ow...

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:31.830
Sorry...

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:40.590
<i>What the hell am I doing?</i>

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.090
<i>Getting so shocked on my own,</i>

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.840
<i>taking it out on Touko...</i>

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.590
<i>I'm scum.</i>

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:58.310
Class Log

00:13:58.560 --> 00:13:59.770
Yukari...

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.940
What're you spacing out for?

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.400
I had a fight with Seigi.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.490
Ah, I get it.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:10.030
How do you understand someone better?

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.910
Good question...

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:15.120
I guess by seeing and hearing 
the same things they do,

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.540
having the same experiences...

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.370
Basically, just getting closer to them.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:22.500
How do I get closer to him than I already am?

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.380
Why don't you just push him down,

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.510
with those overly huge boobs of yours?

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.720
Hey! Don't be stupid!

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:42.770
Lieutenant!

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:47.360
I sent Seigi-kun back to 
school for the time being.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.320
Thanks. Sorry about that.

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.320
I lost my cool back there.

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.540
That's unusual for you.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.550
Lisa's cell phone...

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.430
Is something wrong?

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:12.680
Tom...

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:16.640
Tell the Zama headquarters 
to send reinforcements.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:17.520
Huh?

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.230
Here.

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:22.690
Ah... This is...

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:25.570
quite a hot photo, indeed.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:29.400
What are you looking at?! 
Listen to the recording!

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.650
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.110
Force of habit...

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.540
They clearly say

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:40.290
they're going to transport 
Lisa to the Kingdom today.

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:41.750
I'm...

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.710
good and pissed right now.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.630
I'm going to get revenge.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:57.930
You have surprisingly steady hands.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:59.850
I'm a former med student, after all.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.770
That's news to me.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:05.110
After nearly killing someone 
during play and being ratted out,

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:06.940
I learned moderation.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.400
There, she's all stitched up.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:11.320
But, damn...

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.070
She's got some massive tits.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.660
Why are you here?

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.920
He must think you're his mommy.

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:36.470
Touko...

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.060
I'm sorry about before.

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:42.270
Let's go in.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.150
I was called here, too.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:52.440
Hey, Seigi...

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:56.410
How do you feel about Izzy-san?

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.280
Where's this coming from?

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.700
Just answer me.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:03.250
There's nothing to say, really...

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.960
Roger. Please continue monitoring.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.420
Your guess was on the mark, Lieutenant.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.630
A boat anchored in Yokohama Port

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:15.300
that belongs to the Aryabhata 
Higher-Order Physics Lab

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:17.470
has begun preparations to leave port.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.890
Are you going to get that Lisa woman back?

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:22.890
Thanks, Seigi. I'm glad you came.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:25.770
Huh? Why the formality?

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:33.190
Huh?!

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:42.870
And?

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:44.620
What's the purpose of this?

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:47.370
To protect you from the enemy.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:50.880
Don't you mean my tattoo, not me?

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.420
Both.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:57.010
Void Maker is considered the key to 
solving the mysteries of tattoos.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:00.720
We cannot let the enemy claim it.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:03.470
I have to settle the score with that girl!

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:04.520
I'm going, too!

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.100
There's no chance you'll win.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:09.480
Listen, Seigi-kun, 
under normal circumstances,

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:13.480
you should've been sent back to our 
country, regardless of your will.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:16.240
The protection of your current lifestyle

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:19.490
comes at the cost of the lieutenant's 
breach of military regulations.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:23.410
If you were abducted or killed by the enemy,

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:27.540
the lieutenant would be subject 
to unspeakably severe punishment.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.040
What are you talking about?

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.330
I'm not obligated to play 
along with all that!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:35.960
Do you... want to squander 
the lieutenant's good will?

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:37.260
If you are our ally,

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:40.510
then you should think about our position.

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:43.310
How can you put it that way? That's cheap!

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:47.390
Um... What about me?

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:50.270
Why did you ask me to come here?

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:52.650
Because of the tattoo on your forehead.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:56.740
We believe its power manifests 
by acting in concert with

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:59.070
the activation of 
Schrödinger's Cat's tattoo.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:02.490
But we don't know anything 
about it beyond that.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.040
In case of any unforeseen events,

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:08.790
you will remain with Seigi-kun 
until the operation is complete.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.540
With Seigi?

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.790
Then it's okay for me to stay with Seigi...

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:14.710
Huh?

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:18.760
That's right... I should 
decide that for myself.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:22.970
Seigi, I want to know more about you!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:23.640
I want to understand!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:27.890
So I want to be wherever you are!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:30.810
Touko...

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:33.810
Yeah...

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.820
You're right.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:40.240
What are you thinking?

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:44.530
I may do favors for others,

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.120
but I don't want to owe any favors!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.040
I'll choose my own path!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:54.040
Touko and I will both open 
our own paths to the future!

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:56.170
You couldn't possibly be more childish.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:58.670
Keep that up and you'll get hurt one day!

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:02.220
This isn't what being partners means!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:09.140
Seigi! The exit's closed off!

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:12.310
Don't worry! I'll use my Void Maker to...

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:23.030
You weren't getting rid of just the door?

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:24.610
Well, uh...

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:27.240
The bigger the exit, the better, right?

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:34.420
I'll protect you, Touko.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.210
I promised I would.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:37.340
Seigi...

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:38.460
Let's go!

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:39.300
Yeah!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:54.810
I see... Well, we can't help that.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:59.150
Don't worry. I'll finish this before 
Seigi and Touko-chan get here.

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:02.570
Tom, you continue to keep our 
information under control.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.070
Lieutenant, the target has passed point D.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:06.780
Okay.

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:08.910
Positions, everyone.

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:11.750
We'll give them a warm welcome!

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.810
What is it, Lakha?

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:45.860
You're going to give back 
what's important to me.

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:47.990
Fine.

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:51.120
I had intended to save dessert 
for afterward, but...

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:59.330
I'll have you pay me back 
for this hand right here!

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:42.690
Kill...

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:45.610
You know nothing about me.

00:23:46.070 --> 00:23:47.610
P-Princess?!

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:50.240
Yeah, I know, right?!

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:53.990
Crap... Because I activated 
my tattoo earlier...

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:55.080
Rescue

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:55.030
I'll kill you.
